' UC-ASS-02 — Recover Account Access

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Service User|
start
:1.0 Initiate account recovery process;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Present recovery options & required inputs;

|WAH Service User|
:2.0 Provide identity/recovery identifier;

|WAHrden System|
:2.1 Resolve identity & verify registered recovery methods;
if (Recovery context found?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present recovery unavailable result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :2.2 Issue recovery verification challenge;
endif

|WAH Service User|
:2.3 Submit recovery verification response;

|WAHrden System|
:2.4 Validate recovery response;
if (Response valid?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present verification failure;
  kill
else (Yes)
  if (Additional verification required?) then (Yes [2.5])
    :Request additional verification step;
    |WAH Service User|
    :2.6 Provide additional verification input;
    |WAHrden System|
    :2.7 Validate additional verification;
    if (Valid?) then (No [EF-03])
      :Present additional verification failure;
      kill
    else (Yes)
    endif
  else (No)
  endif
  :3.0 Present reset/recovery action screen;
endif

|WAH Service User|
if (Submit new access details?) then (No / Cancel [EF-05])
  :Cancel recovery action;
  kill
else (Yes [3.1])
  :Submit and confirm new credentials;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:3.2 Validate submitted recovery information;
if (Inputs satisfy security policies?) then (No [EF-04])
  :Present validation error & prompt retry;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :4.0 Restore access / update credential;
  if (Processing successful?) then (No [EF-06])
    :Present recovery failure result;
    kill
  else (Yes)
    |Database / Audit|
    :4.1 Record recovery event & audit trail;
    
    |WAHrden System|
    :4.2 Present recovery success result;
  endif
endif

|WAH Service User|
:Proceed with recovered account;
stop
@enduml
